  "fullDescription": "Bring heartwarming cuteness to your creative projects with this 50 Kawaii Mama Animals Clipart Bundle! Each design features adorable mom and baby animal pairs adorned with delicate floral crowns, all illustrated in a charming kawaii pastel cartoon style on a clean background.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nMother’s Day cards and crafts\n\nNursery wall art\n\nBaby shower invitations\n\nScrapbooking and journaling\n\nT-shirt and sublimation designs\n\nPrint-on-demand projects\n\nThis set includes 50 high-quality PNG files (300 DPI) with transparent backgrounds, featuring a wide variety of animals like bunnies, foxes, elephants, koalas, giraffes, pandas, and more – each lovingly detailed with unique flower crowns.\n\nKey Features:\n\n50 unique kawaii mom & baby animal cliparts\n\nTransparent background PNGs (300 DPI)\n\nReady for use in Cricut, sublimation, and print projects\n\nCommercial Use included\n\nAdd a touch of sweet motherhood and nature to your next design project with this lovable kawaii floral animal clipart set – exclusively on Creative Fabrica!",
